// An event that an event log has no room for is lost to every reactive
// `for` that reads the log, not only to the one that has read least of
// it (Inputs/reactive_lost.ent): the 100 new entities are more than the
// log's 64 entries, q1 runs and has read past them, and w1's five events
// then find the log full for q2, which has not run. q1 has to see those
// five in the next frame, with the 40 of w2: 45 a frame for both.
// RUN: %ent run %S/Inputs/reactive_lost.ent 2>/dev/null | FileCheck %s

// CHECK:      1: 100 100
// CHECK-NEXT: 2: 145 145
// CHECK-NEXT: 3: 190 190
// CHECK-NEXT: 4: 235 235
// CHECK:      8: 415 415
